PE 810: XOR-Primes / 异或素数

=== XOR Multiplication Definition ===
Numbers are treated as polynomials over GF(2):
  Binary representation → polynomial coefficients
  13 (1101) → x^3 + x^2 + 1

XOR multiplication a ⊗ b:
  Multiply polynomials, use XOR for coefficient addition
  Example: 2 ⊗ 3 = 6
    2 (10) = x
    3 (11) = x + 1
    x * (x + 1) = x^2 + x → (110)_2 = 6

